# Scratch worktrees for stacked branches
.worktrees/

# cargo-mutants run output (agent-ix/quoin#48). Regenerated by `make mutants`;
# a run is ~90k lines of logs and per-mutant diffs, and it describes one
# machine at one commit rather than anything the next reader needs.
mutants.out/
mutants.out.old/

# NOTE: proptest regression seeds are deliberately NOT ignored. proptest writes
# `<test>.proptest-regressions` when a property fails and re-runs those exact
# cases before generating novel ones, so the file is how a discovered
# counterexample stays discovered. Its own header says to check it in. Ignoring
# the pattern would silently drop every future failing seed.

